{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"大平原を配りあるく日奈子です。\n101回目ということで1回目に立ち戻ってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！101回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n世界で一番孤独なGGさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/16/3304337/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝、夜が明けた熊本県の地震のことを\nニュースでみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ日本で起こってることとは思えなく、\n信じられません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私でも、誰かの力になれるように\n思いやりを忘れずに\nあたたかい心を忘れずにします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も変わらない元通りになることは\n難しいですが\n少しでもはやく被災された方が\n日常に戻れるように願っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/16/3304337/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/16/3304337/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  ひろと。さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ひなこーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎なーーにーー！コメントありがとーーう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  kkkさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんありがとう！\nがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎みんなで助け合って、協力しあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばりましょう！。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(300)  マックスFrom北海道さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎こんばんは。\n真夏の全国ツアー、当選しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こんばんは！わお！とても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(415)  くっちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃちゃんの思うじょしらくの見所はどこ～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎たくさんありますが、\n今回は、前回より北野日奈子じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぐちゃんという目線でみてほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話しも、ニュアンスやテンポ感で\n伝えたいことが上手く伝わるかな。。。っていう会話を若さんやひなちまとしたりして、3人で台本を見ながら、\nマリーさん、テトちゃん、くくちゃん、きぐちゃん、がんちゃんが\nどういう気持ちなのかを\n意見を交換しあって話したりしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、本当に時間のない中\n稽古をします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通し稽古まで、あと数回しか\n普通の稽古がありません(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームごは、若さんとれなち以外\nみんなアンダーライブがあり\nチームで合わせる回数も\n限られてしまうので、凄く頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、去年と同じきぐちゃんを演じさせてもらうし、また同じチーンごのメンバーです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のきぐちゃんを超えるきぐちゃん。\n去年のチームごを超えるチームご。\n去年のじょしらくを超えるじょしらく弐。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に必ずします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りしかありません！楽しんで頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ふくちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃーちゃんの妄想見たよ！\nすげぇーキュンキュンした！\nきぃーちゃんみたいな後輩だったらすぐ落ちるわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎わあ！すごく嬉しい！ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年上より、年下を演じる方が\n私には合うと思ってたので\n今回、後輩の女の子になれて嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妄想リクエストたのしいの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやりたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/16/3304337/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/16/3304337/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n92回目はありぽんさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセで待ってるね！！\nおやすみなさい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.短いですが、今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ